Loaded at run time, not bundled
-------------------------------
- avr8js (Wokwi, MIT) — bundled from npm (dependency `avr8js`).
- @horang-corp/avr-gcc-wasm 0.2.0 — AVR-GCC and binutils as WebAssembly
  (GPL-3.0) with precompiled Arduino core and library objects under their
  own licences (see the package's THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md). Loaded lazily from
  the jsDelivr CDN only when a student compiles; never copied into this repo.
- The studio HDRI (public/hdri/studio_small_03_1k.hdr) is Poly Haven's
  "Studio Small 03", CC0.
